  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Sustainable Finance Facility (SFF) is India&#x2019;s first technical assistance platform dedicated to the design of innovative financial instruments that mobilize public and private capital for the SDGs. Anchored with the Department of Economic Affairs (DEA), Ministry of Finance, and co-financed by the European Union (EU), the Facility strengthens India&#x2019;s sustainable finance ecosystem by addressing market gaps, building institutional capacity, and demonstrating proof-of-concept models for scale.</narrative>
  </description>
